id: pm-github-sync-alert-ownership
title: Require ownership before mutating sync failure alerts
description: "GitHub issue: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/issues/280. The reusable sync workflow can close, reopen or overwrite a same-title issue opened by another author."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-github#280"
created_at: "2026-11-26T06:59:45.525Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-26T07:40:08.453Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Protect same-title issues from other authors on failure and success; mark created and refreshed alerts; keep recovering legacy bot alerts; document caller ownership; verify extracted shell in tests.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-26T06:59:48.497Z",codex-agent,Read issue 280 and the linked caller and implementation pull requests. Reproduce using the existing extracted-shell test harness with synthetic GitHub responses. The closeout and other reusable workflows have no sibling issue alert.
  "2026-11-26T07:00:47.682Z",codex-agent,"Baseline extracted shell reproduced the issue against synthetic GitHub API pages: recovery closed the human issue, failed sync edited an open human issue, and failed sync reopened and edited a closed human issue. Eight ownership and documentation assertions failed, and two unchanged guard tests passed."
  "2026-11-26T07:05:27.578Z",codex-agent,"Implementation requires the GitHub Actions bot plus a hidden body marker and prefers marked candidates even after a rename. The exact-title bot fallback keeps old alerts recoverable and gains the marker on refresh. Summary output includes only a count of skipped same-title issues. Reviewed reusable workflows, shell scripts, issue mutation commands, report formats, and package entry points. Only the sync alert job had a title-only target lookup."
  "2026-11-26T07:05:29.879Z",codex-agent,"Disposable revert proof with the fixed tests: workflow-only revert 7 failed and 3 passed. Removing the author guard failed 6, ignoring the marker failed 3, removing legacy fallback failed 2, removing the summary failed 5, removing the body marker write failed 6, and disabling creation failed 3. Reverting each of README.md, docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml and docs/daily-sync-recovery.md independently failed the documentation test. The restored workflow and docs passed 10 of 10. The pinned pm linked-test run also passed 10 of 10."
  "2026-11-26T07:40:05.714Z",codex-agent,"Local validation passed: 933 of 933 Node tests with zero skips across the 22 affected and identity/privacy test files, 10 of 10 direct Bun alert tests, typecheck, lint, source and test builds, ownership inventory, and the repository privacy audit. The PR workflow runs quick npm release and coverage checks plus Bun consumer smoke. The deep npm and Bun matrix is configured for main, scheduled and manual runs. The orchestrator owns release and caller pinning."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project
  test/daily-sync-alert.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
